<br>
1. UMME LAILA KA THA NOUHA MERE PYARE AKBAR <br>
 TUM KAHAN CHOODKE MADAR KO SIDHARE AKBAR<br>
<br>
2. AARZO MAA KO BAHUT THI KE RACHAYE SHAADI <br>
 KHAAK MAY MILGAYE ARMAAN HAMARE AKBAR<br>
<br>
3. PAAS HUMSHAKLE PAYAMBER KI NA RAKHAY DUNIYA <br>
 SAR TERA TANN SE MUSALMAN UTAARE AKBAR<br>
<br>
4. QATT MAY SUGRA NE LIKHA HAI KE AB AAO BHAIYYA <br>
 HAI BAHEN AAPKI AB GOOR KANARE AKBAR<br>
<br>
5. KHOON BHARA CHEHRA HAI OR KHAAK E BIYABAN SAR PAR <br>
 KISTARAHA MAA TERI ZULFOUN KO SAWARE AKBAR<br>
<br>
6. PAAS CHADAR NAHI JO TUJH KO UDHATI MADAR <br>
 ZAQM JALTE HAIN TERE JISM KE SAARE AKBAR<br>
<br>
7. QASIM O AUN O MOHD NAHI ABBAS NAHI <br>
 DASHTE GURBAT MAY CHHOTAY SAARE SAHARE AKBAR<br>
<br>
8. CHHOD KAR BAAP KO TANHA NAHI JAATAY BETA <br>
 TUM HO BABA KI ZAAEFI KE SAHARE AKBAR<br>
<br>
9. MAA TADAP KAR YAHI KAHTI RAHI MAQTAL MAY LAEEQ <br>
 CHHUP GAYE SABKI NIGAHOUN SE HAMARE AKBAR<br>
